    "text": "The distance of two points on the axis of a magnet from its centre is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> respectively. The ratio of magnetic intensity at these points is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. The length of the magnet will be",
