  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The magnetic field on the axis of a bar magnet of length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math>, having a pole strength&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>,&nbsp;at a distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>mld</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>.5</mo></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>400</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>= 5</mo><mi>cm</mi></math><br /><br />Hence, length of magnet <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>= 10</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p>",
